e":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#developer-tools","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Developer Tools","description":"\u003cp\u003eHost code, build, test, and deploy your applications quickly and effectively with AWS developer tools. Leverage core tools like software development kits (SDKs), code editors, and continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) services for DevOps software development. Use machine learning (ML) -guided best practices and abstractions to improve agility, security, velocity, and code quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#segurosmultiples","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"segurosmultiples","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"La Cooperativa Seguros Múltiples es una de las más grandes aseguradoras de Puerto Rico, con más de 600 mil clientes. Para mantenerse a la vanguardia en tecnología, la compañía hace inversiones continuas para fortalecer sus canales virtuales y todo lo que es innovación para mejorar la experiencia de sus asociados. Este año, Seguros Múltiples incorporó el asistente virtual Alexa de Amazon a los servicios de atención que ofrecen a los asegurados.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/segurosmultiples_logo%401x.e4499fadbd245f10a2672060d5d39ed61a0bc06f.png","displayLocation":"Puerto Rico","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/segurosmultiples/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Cooperativa de Seguros Multiples de Puerto